<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending October 12, 1996, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  10-12-96		351,000	    250.6</p>
<p>week ending:  10-05-96		343,000	    249.5</p>
<p>year ago:     10-14-1995	    357,000	    249.0</p>
